{"id":"aventura","lemma":"aventura","pos":"noun","rank":1424,"glosses":["adventure","affair, fling (an adulterous relationship)"],"ipa":"/abenˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"aventuras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aventura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy listo para la aventura.","en":"I'm ready for the adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823867"},{"text":"Le gustan las aventuras.","en":"He likes adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450170"},{"text":"A él le gusta la aventura.","en":"He likes adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78157"},{"text":"Él nos contó una fabulosa historia de aventuras.","en":"He told us a very exciting adventure story."},{"text":"Él está teniendo una aventura con su secretaria.","en":"He is having an affair with his secretary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693303"}]}